  "worked_solution": "The speed is $55$ miles per hour. To find the distance covered in $3$ hours, we multiply the speed by $3.$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{distance} & =\\text{speed}\\cdot \\text{time} \\\\  & =55\\times 3 \\\\  & =165.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the car covered $165$ miles in $3$ hours.",
